{"id":"nd93314d7f8","headline":"Jumbo to return €161 million to shareholders throughout 2026","summary":"Greek retailer Jumbo kept its 2026 guidance, forecasting sales growth of about 5% and net profit of €310–320 million. Sales recovered after a temporary ceasefire in the Iran conflict, and it plans €161 million in shareholder returns.","why":"Jumbo is a major Greek toy and children's retail chain listed in Athens, so its guidance offers a read on Greek consumer demand and retail earnings.","category":"companies","event_type":"guidance","importance":1,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Athens","country":"Greece","lat":37.984,"lon":23.727,"region":"eu"},"entities":[{"name":"Jumbo SA","ticker":null,"kind":"company","unresolved":"no-ticker"}],"links":[],"source":{"name":"cyprus-mail.com","url":"https://cyprus-mail.com/2026/07/16/jumbo-to-return-e161-million-to-shareholders-throughout-2026"},"sources":[{"name":"cyprus-mail.com","url":"https://cyprus-mail.com/2026/07/16/jumbo-to-return-e161-million-to-shareholders-throughout-2026"}],"published_at":"2026-07-16T10:34:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T12:21:21Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"301fb09d336d302e","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T12:21:21Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-07-16T10:34:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-07-16T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"RO","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/shopping-retail-store-4516039.jpg","alt":"shopping retail store (illustration)","credit":"Preis_King","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/shopping-venture-shopping-laptop-4516039/"}}